Open a workspace file whose folders value is not a list.

A workspace file whose folders value is an object, a non-zero number or true
makes toWorkspaceFolders throw before the workspace exists; start-up then throws
again and the page never builds a workbench. Treat a non-list folders value as
an empty list on first load, and keep the current folders when a running window
reloads a non-list folders value.

